# The Simulate screen: flights + conditions, events strip and linked plots, results, ground track, compare.
# Run with the example rocket loaded:
#   cargo run -q -p bowshock -- drive --example crates/bowshock/scripts/simulate.drive out/simulate
viewport 1280x800

# Simulate mode (the top bar's switch), before anything has run.
click (663, 18)
screenshot SimulateScreen-empty.png

# Run the selected flight (Nominal) on a worker thread; the result lands before the next step.
click "Run"
screenshot SimulateScreen-dark.png

# Hover: one crosshair across the plots, a dot on the ground track.
move (560, 300)
move (570, 300)
screenshot SimulateScreen-hover.png

# PlotZoom: drag a band along x, Enter zooms, Esc steps back.
press (500, 300)
move (560, 300)
move (640, 300)
release (640, 300)
screenshot PlotZoom-band.png
type enter
move (600, 300)
screenshot PlotZoom-dark.png
type escape

# Clicking a result number moves the crosshair to that moment.
click "Time to apogee"
screenshot SimulateScreen-seek.png

# Run all four flights, then tick three of them (colours follow the tick order).
click "Run all"
click (17, 94)
click (17, 138)
click (17, 226)
move (640, 300)
move (650, 300)
screenshot SimulateCompare-dark.png

# A flight's own conditions: pick Windy and change the wind; its result goes stale (ink-faint) until it is run again.
click "Windy"
screenshot SimulateCompare-select.png

# Light theme.
click "Light"
screenshot SimulateCompare-light.png
click (17, 94)
click (17, 138)
click (17, 226)
screenshot SimulateScreen-light.png
